Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:44.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《侏罗纪公园3》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:51.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(索拿岛 哥斯达黎加西方207英里)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:54.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(禁区)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:27.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都准备好了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能开得越近越好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you get as close as you can!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.72,0:01:33.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好的话 另外有赏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you something extra if you make it a good trip!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.23,0:01:37.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽量的 但不能太近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get you close, my friend, but not too close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.73,0:01:39.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则会被吃掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want to be eaten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:41.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready, amigo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.23,0:01:43.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:51.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一   二   三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two, three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.74,0:01:54.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(恐龙飞伞)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:01.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克  宾  加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric! Ben!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:16.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怕吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scared?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:18.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不怕  好刺激{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-uh, this is great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:32.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有看到什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See anything yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:34.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.81,0:03:05.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:06.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:12.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧点  怎么回事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:13.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,镇静点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.32,0:03:16.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫他们停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.83,0:03:23.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们人呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.83,0:03:25.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:30.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们要撞上了!  - 不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're gonna crash! We're gonna crash! -  No, we're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.34,0:03:35.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我先松绑 好放掉绳索  - 我们要撞上了!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm gonna cut this loose! Let go of the rope!   - We're gonna crash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,手拿开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.35,0:03:41.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快拿开  快一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:45.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:57.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be okay, bud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:21.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些是草食恐龙  所以不会互相攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually,those are herbivores.They wouldn't be interested in fighting each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.41,0:04:25.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些是肉食恐龙  它们才喜欢互相蚕食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these are carnivores, and they really like fighting with each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.41,0:04:29.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们用牙和爪子  去撕裂对方的喉咙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They use their teeth and claws to rip each other's throats out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:32.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿伦  他才三岁  等五岁再教吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, he's three. Let's wait till he's five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查理  抱歉啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, right. Sorry, Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:37.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 艾丽  - 什么事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ellie. -  What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是汤姆  他要和你谈最后一章{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Tom again. He has to talk to you about the last chapter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.42,0:04:42.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他我一定要引用杰克霍纳的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell him I'm not gonna lose the Jack Horner quote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:45.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的编辑认为他是古生物学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My editor thinks he's a paleontologist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:49.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马克  你看看是谁来了?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Mark. Hey, babe, look who's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.44,0:04:52.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是阿伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.44,0:04:54.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Nice to meet you, Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:59.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  这是草食恐龙  他是恐龙先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy,this's a herbivore and that's the dinosaur man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:00.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恐龙先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dinosaur man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:05.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杰克  我叫什么  是阿伦吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, say my name. Is my name Alan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:06.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我名字是阿伦吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is my name Alan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:12.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它本来知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:15.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伤心吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:17.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喝咖啡  谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,马克现在在国务院做事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you know Mark's working for the State Department now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:22.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做哪方面的事?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. What do you do, Mark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.97,0:05:26.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,国际关系  多半是法律协定之类的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}International relations, mostly treaty law and things like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:29.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 小家伙在抗议了   - 我去看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Call of the wild one. -  Here, I'll get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.97,0:05:33.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好好聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys...catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:34.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:38.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他真是个好人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a great guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:43.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你都在研究什么?  - 以迅猛龙为主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, what are you working on now? -  Raptors, mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢的主题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.49,0:05:47.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你记得它们的声音吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember the sounds they made?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:50.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我尽量不去想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I try not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:53.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过去我们对它们智慧和能力的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, all our theories about raptor intelligence,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:56.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,评估相当不正确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what they're capable of we weren't even close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:59.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快告诉我   - 我们做过头盖骨化石的扫描{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell me. -  We did cranium scans of a fossil skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:02.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发现了一个精密的共鸣腔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found what looks like a very sophisticated resonating chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.01,0:06:06.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  所以当初我们说它们能发声是正确的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we were right? They had the ability to vocalize?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.51,0:06:08.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我确信这是它们群居的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm convinced that's the key to their social intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:11.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也解释了它们的团队行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which explains why they could work together as a team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:14.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,能协调攻击  而不让被捕食者发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And coordinate their attacks so the prey wouldn't know what was going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.52,0:06:15.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们能互相交谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They could talk to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:17.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且已超出我们的想象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To a degree we never imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.02,0:06:20.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们很聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie, they were smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比海豚  鲸鱼更聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were smarter than dolphins or whales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至比灵长类还要聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were smarter than primates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:35.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说如果你需要帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to say, if you ever need help with anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:37.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别忘了找我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes you forget to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.04,0:06:39.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管打电话来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何时间  任何事都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything, anytime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.55,0:06:49.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你仍是最杰出的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're still the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:52.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是真心话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.06,0:06:55.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜我是仅存的一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last of my breed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:07.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,经过多重的前腔研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through the painstaking study of the anterior chamber in multiple specimens,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:12.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们确定了上颚和喉头的关联{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can determine the exciting correlation between the upper palate and the larynx.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:16.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,依此推断  注意这是推断{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This lets us theorize... theorize,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:19.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迅猛龙是可以发声的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mind you that the raptor was capable of sophisticated vocalizations...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:22.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由此可见这是一个巨大的进化{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which would have been a tremendous evolutionary advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.09,0:07:27.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迅猛龙它凶猛  聪明而且有社交能力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raptors were fierce, intelligent and socially sophisticated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:31.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道分组出去猎食  并且能互相协调{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were able to hunt in numbers... and coordinate their efforts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若不是洪水使它们绝迹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were it not for the cataclysmic events which overtook them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.60,0:07:37.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如今控制地球生物的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's entirely possible that raptors rather than...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:42.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很可能不是人类  而是迅猛龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}humans would have become the dominant species on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:45.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望这能引起你们的兴趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope this has been of interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:49.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做为古生物学者  这个发现着实让人兴奋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It certainly excites us as paleontologists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.11,0:07:51.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有许多东西有待发掘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. There's much, much more to discover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:56.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因此我们不断的请求你们的支持{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why we continue to need and ask for your support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:01.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.14,0:08:14.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常谢谢  格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much, Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:16.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有问题吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, does anyone have a question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:20.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:24.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁有和侏罗纪公园无关的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does anyone have a question that does not relate to Jurassic Park?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.65,0:08:32.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是和我未参与的圣地亚哥事件无关的问题?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the incident in San Diego...which I did not witness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:36.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,您的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:40.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迅猛龙的理论很好  但都是猜测  是不是?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your theory on raptors is good and all, but isn't all this conjecture moot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:45.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一旦联合国和哥斯达黎加决定如何处置第二个岛屿后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once the U.N. and Costa Rica and everyone decides how to handle that second island,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:48.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科学家一定会自行进入寻求线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scientists will just go in and look for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:52.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恐龙生存在六千五百万年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dinosaurs lived 65 million years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.18,0:08:56.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如今都已变成化石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is left of them is fossilized in the rocks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.68,0:09:01.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以真正的发现是从岩石中得来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it is in the rock that real scientists make real discoveries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.19,0:09:04.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,汉蒙和遗传国际公司所做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, what John Hammond and Ingen did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.69,0:09:08.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是在侏罗纪公园内  以基因制造出巨兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Jurassic Park...is create genetically engineered theme park monsters,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.19,0:09:10.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如此而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing more and nothing less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说即使有机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying that you wouldn't want to get onto Isla Sorna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:16.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不会到索拿岛去做研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and study them, if you had the chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:22.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何力量能让我去那个岛屿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No force on Earth or heaven could get me on that island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:36.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,奈许  都有什么武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what we got here, Nashy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:38.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,20毫米铁角龙是半自动瓦斯操作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iron horn 20-millimeter, gas-operated, semiautomatic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十发旋转子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ten-shot magazine, rotating bolt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.23,0:09:44.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,减低后座力的枪支  烈性炸药  燃烧弹...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}recoil-reducing muzzle break, high explosive incendiary...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:53.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是余戴斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Udesky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:55.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是保罗  刚检查...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Udesky, this is Paul Kirby. Just checking...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.74,0:09:58.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我们这里已经准备就绪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, sir. We're good to go here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:03.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等钱一付  一切就搞定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact,I can lock things down just as soon as you drop me that payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:10.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不错  这两个是最好的人选{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's right. Two of the very best men I could possibly find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:13.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和他们一起工作过吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you worked with these men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然没有一起工作过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, I haven't worked with them personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:20.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但介绍人极力推荐他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, believe me, sir, both of these men come very highly recommended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:31.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  你放心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing to worry about, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.78,0:10:33.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定能轻松的达成任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be a walk in the park.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.85,0:10:41.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(蒙大拿州 峰垒湖)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.79,0:10:45.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比利  我的方法可能不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy, I don't think I'm doing this right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用牙刷试试看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's try the toothbrush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要慢慢来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to go slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一次一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just take a little bit at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.81,0:11:07.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我老分不清岩石和骨头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can never tell what's rock and what's bone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.31,0:11:08.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其实都是岩石{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Technically, it's all rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:12.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只不过骨头里的钙被石化而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The calcium in the bones is replaced during fossilization.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.82,0:11:14.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以感到它们的不同  你瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you can feel the difference. See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,粗糙  光滑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rough... smooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:22.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,粗糙  光滑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rough, smooth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:25.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(洛矶山博物馆古生物学部门)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:30.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.84,0:11:33.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Brennan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:35.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有收获吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:39.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还来得及改变主修科目{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not too late to change your major, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来不太好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not good, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:43.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很糟  我们只剩四个礼拜的经费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worse. We're gonna have to pack up in four weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:44.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三个礼拜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:47.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我租了一些设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to rent equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.35,0:11:49.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给你看点东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here, I gotta show you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:50.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢电脑  对不对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like computers, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还喜欢算盘呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like the abacus, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:55.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是古生物学的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet the future of paleontology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:57.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是快速原型机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a rapid prototyper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把迅猛龙头骨资料输入进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I enter in the scan data from the raptor's skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:03.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电脑把它分成上千的切片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The computer breaks it down into thousands of slices.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.87,0:12:07.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后这个设备就开始造型  一次一层{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then this thing sculpts it, one layer at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.90,0:12:08.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(原型完成)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:09.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:23.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是迅猛龙的共鸣腔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you the resonating chamber of a Velociraptor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.89,0:12:25.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.90,0:12:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太高明了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. This is brilliant, Billy. Really, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.81,0:12:43.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只可惜晚了点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sad to say, it's just a little bit late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:48.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是克比企业公司的保罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paul Kirby. Kirby Enterprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的名片  比利  你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, my card. How you doing, Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:54.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么能为你效劳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I do for you, Mr. Kirby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:58.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先  我非常崇拜你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, um, first thing, I 'm a great admirer of yours,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:02.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其次  有个建议想和你讨论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have a proposition I'd like to discuss with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.43,0:13:04.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你赏光今晚和我们共进晚餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you have dinner with my wife and me this evening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:06.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,由我请客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be our treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:09.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的好意  我才旅行回来  很累{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that'd be great, but I'm tired. I've been traveling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:11.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,改天吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe some other time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:13.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  这很值得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, this will be worth your while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就这么说定  - 太好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'd love to. -  Oh, terrific.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我最欣赏这种精神  - 那就今晚见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's the spirit. Good. -  This evening then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:31.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 格兰特博士  比利  - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, Billy. Dr. Grant. -  How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:34.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 阿曼达  比利  - 克比太太  你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Amanda, Billy. -  Mrs. Kirby, how are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要喝什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what are you boys drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 冰钻鸡尾酒  - 来两杯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ice Pick, Catfish. -  Two, please, Cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.96,0:13:42.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很崇拜你的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've admired your work for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常具有启发性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really truly inspiring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿曼达和我很喜爱户外生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amanda and I just love the outdoors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.97,0:13:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几乎参加过所有的探险团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heck, we've been on just about every adventure tour they can come up with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.47,0:13:53.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,象尼罗河  加拉帕哥斯群岛  喀喇昆仑山脉...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Nile, Galapagos, K2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:57.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们甚至预订月球首航之旅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We even have two seats reserved on the first commercial flight to the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:14:00.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以在我们结婚纪念那天  {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for our wedding anniversary this year...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想做点特别的活动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we wanted to do something really special.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.49,0:14:03.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那种  - 一生难忘的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something So... -  Once in a lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:08.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们包了一架飞机  到索拿岛去探险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've chartered an airplane to fly us over Isla Sorna...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:10.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你做我们的向导{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'd like you to be our guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:14.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,酒来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:19.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的赏识  可是我很忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a very kind offer, Mr. Kirby, but I'm a very, very busy man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:23.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过倒可以介绍几个  非常合格的人给你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can recommend a couple of guys who are really highly qualified that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:27.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你曾亲眼看过它们  所以最合适{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. You're the best. You've seen these animals in the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你甚至曾和它们面对面过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no one that even comes close to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.51,0:14:34.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但依规定不能低飞  所以你根本看不到什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't be able to fly low enough to see anything of any real interest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:38.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妙在他们特许我们低飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, see? That's the interesting part...because we have permission to fly low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:40.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多低?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How low?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:45.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是飞航专家  但我知道比任何人都低{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm no aviation expert, but a heck of a lot lower than anybody else, I can tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.03,0:14:49.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就我所知  要多低都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From what I understand, it's pretty much. It's whatever we want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.53,0:14:51.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真难以相信{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's hard to believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:55.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的公司  所经营的进出口业务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, through my business dealings...import, export, emerging markets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:57.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,使我结交了不少高层朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've made a lot of friends in high places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:15:00.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连哥斯达黎加的政府也不例外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this case, the Costa Rican government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:05.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的参与对我们非常重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant, you have no idea how important it is to us that you come along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.55,0:15:06.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这是成功的关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would make all the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.05,0:15:08.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克比太太{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Kirby, I-I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.05,0:15:13.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也愿意捐款支持你的研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, of course, we'd love to make a contribution to your research here. So{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:18.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何数目都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could write all kinds of numbers on this check, Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.06,0:15:21.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:24.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要多少钱?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what's it gonna take?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.58,0:15:42.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我付你的钱不少  买个好点的袋子吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even with what I pay you, couldn't you afford a better bag?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.59,0:15:46.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的幸运袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way. This one's lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:49.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几年前和朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple years ago, some buddies and I{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:52.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到新西兰的峭壁上做滑翔飞行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}went hang gliding off these cliffs in New Zealand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:57.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上升气流突然把我扫到一边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this big updraft came and swept me right against the side, wham!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:58.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那的确很幸运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that does sound lucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:02.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这条背带救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This strap alone saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:05.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我跌落时它刚好钩在岩石上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got hooked on a rock as I was falling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:09.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟达尔文进化论刚好相反  "愚者生存"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reverse Darwinism: survival of the most idiotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.11,0:16:14.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你给我这次机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, I want to thank you for bringing me along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:17.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,反正回来后骨头仍然在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, the bones will still be there when we get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:19.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,研究骨头的好处就是它跑不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the great thing about bones: They never run away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:25.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当初是你把我扯进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is, you got me into this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:29.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我绝不会放过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have no intention of being on my own with these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:34.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别太兴奋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't get too excited, Billy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很可能什么也看不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chances are we won't see a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  到时候拜托叫醒我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your turn to be nice. Wake me when we get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:50.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么认识克比的?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, how do you know the Kirbys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.16,0:16:53.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在教堂认识的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, through our church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.18,0:17:15.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:16.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒  我们快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up. We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:38.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是圣胡安  一架不明飞机正接近索拿岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unidentified aircraft approaching Isla Sorna, this is San Juan Approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.70,0:17:40.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在禁区飞行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're flying in restricted airspace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:43.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请尽快回头...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immediately turn to coordinates two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:35.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天呀  我几乎都忘了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, I'd forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.27,0:18:50.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  我们终于到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did it, honey. We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:53.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,古伯  如果看到什么就大叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cooper, if you see anything, yell up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是说不准叫吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I thought I'd keep it to myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:58.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  从左边看过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Everyone, if you look out the left of the plane,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.79,0:19:01.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们会看到成群的腕龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can see a whole herd of brachiosaurs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.79,0:19:05.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,雄性首领走在队伍的最前面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, you can see in the front of the group, the alpha male grazing there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.29,0:19:08.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,余戴斯  奈许  前面有东西吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Udesky, Nash, how 'bout up front? You guys see anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:09.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么也没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing yet, Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:13.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这边看过去是一群三角龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean... Mrs. Kirby, look. Out here you'll see a group of triceratops{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:17.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里有跑道  要降落吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kirby, we have a landing strip up ahead. You want me to put it down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:20.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要  先绕全岛一圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. I told you, I want to circle first, see the whole island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:22.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么意思  不能在这里降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean set it down? You can't land here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:24.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么  - 等一下  我可以解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? -  Hold on. I can explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.31,0:19:26.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝不能在这岛上降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot land on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:29.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  你不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be fine. You just don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.31,0:19:31.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你疯啦  - 拜托坐下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you crazy? -  Sit down, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:34.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士  请你先坐下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant, will you please sit down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:48.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比利  我们没降落吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy, tell me we didn't land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:53.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克  宾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric? Eric? Ben? Eric?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:55.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们似乎在找人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they're looking for someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:10.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧  抱歉我们打...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Dr. Grant, are you all right? I'm sorry we had to be so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:12.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁打我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who hit me? Who hit me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:13.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是古伯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That would be Cooper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.33,0:20:16.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们在做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.33,0:20:18.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,清理四周  使这里更安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're setting up a perimeter to make the place safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.83,0:20:21.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 这里没有安全的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys are good. On this island, there is no such thing as safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.83,0:20:23.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最好回到飞机上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get back on that plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:27.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让你太太别叫了  这样太危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you tell your wife to stop making that noise? That is a very, very bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.34,0:20:28.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:33.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿曼达宝贝  格兰特博士说  那样很危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ben? Amanda? Honey? Dr. Grant said that's a bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:34.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:37.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说太危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says it's a bad idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a bad idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:43.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.35,0:20:46.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是霸王龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a tyrannosaurus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:49.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  比霸王龙还要大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so. It sounds bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.86,0:20:55.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to leave! We have to leave now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:20:58.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.87,0:21:01.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到飞机上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:05.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,另外那个人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the other guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:08.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,古伯能保护自己的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cooper's a professional. He can handle himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.88,0:21:11.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快上去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the plane! Hurry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:13.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.90,0:21:25.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保罗  我们不能  {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paul, we can't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.94,0:21:28.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我们只绕着岛飞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. We'll just circle the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.40,0:21:29.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand, Udesky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:49.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:51.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他想干什么  - 那是古伯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? -  That's Cooper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:54.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:56.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coop, get out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:21:59.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我不能停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I can't stop this plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:02.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.94,0:22:07.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,燃料被切断  我们要坠毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuel cut off!  We're going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:34.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.97,0:22:36.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're okay up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:39.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家别乱动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone just stay put.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.97,0:22:41.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,呼叫圣胡安  请求援助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}San Juan Approach, Mayday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.97,0:22:43.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁有卫星电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who has the satellite phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.47,0:22:45.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:46.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.98,0:22:49.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,无线电通话器坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not getting anything. The radio's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.49,0:22:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没着陆呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't landed yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.99,0:23:06.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所有线路都在忙线中  该死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All circuits are busy. Damn it! Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:08.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:15.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep still! Keep still! What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.01,0:23:16.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:20.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么  抓稳了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? Hold it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:23.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家抓紧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.53,0:23:44.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,救命呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.10,0:24:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克比太太  快回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Kirby, come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.60,0:24:51.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.65,0:25:39.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着我  往这边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me! This way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.16,0:25:49.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到这里来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.19,0:26:25.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该甩掉它了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we lost him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.70,0:26:31.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  是死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, it's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.70,0:26:37.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家都不准动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody move a muscle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.50,0:27:42.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你别打了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Please, please don't. Stop, p-please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.51,0:27:46.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好给我个解释{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time you did some explaining, Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.01,0:27:48.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们求过所有的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We called everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.01,0:27:50.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,试过所有办法  根本没用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did everything we could. No one would help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.51,0:27:53.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哥斯达黎加政府说这里是禁止飞行区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Costa Rican government said this is a no-fly zone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.02,0:27:54.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,美国大使馆...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The U.S. Embassy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.02,0:27:57.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们自己的大使馆  {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's our U.S. Embassy told us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.17,0:27:59.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,居然叫我们接受事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we should accept the inevitable. Can you believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.02,0:28:02.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎能让12岁小孩单独飞拖曳伞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let a 12-year-old go parasailing alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.03,0:28:02.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.03,0:28:04.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他和我朋友一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't alone. He was with a friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.03,0:28:06.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字是宾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ben Hildebrand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.03,0:28:09.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和保罗一年前离婚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paul and I divorced over a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.53,0:28:11.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么找我?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.03,0:28:13.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说需要找曾到过岛上的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said we needed someone who'd been on the island before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.54,0:28:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我没叫你去绑架呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but I did not tell you to kidnap somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.54,0:28:20.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没来过这座岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never been on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.04,0:28:22.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你书都写了 怎么会没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you have. You wrote that book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.55,0:28:27.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是努布拉岛  这是索拿岛  B地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was Isla Nublar. This is Isla Sorna, site "B."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.05,0:28:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有两个不同的恐龙岛?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean there are two islands with dinosaurs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.05,0:28:30.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  没你的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay out of this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.05,0:28:32.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们失踪多久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how long have they been missing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.56,0:28:33.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,八个星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.56,0:28:35.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将近八个星期{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost eight weeks now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:40.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比利 我们到飞机里尽量多拿点东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy. We go back to the plane and salvage what we can,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.06,0:28:42.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后就朝海边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then we make for the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.07,0:28:45.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士  找不到儿子我们绝不离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant, we're not leaving this island without our son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.57,0:28:48.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以自己去找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you can go and look for him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.57,0:28:51.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则就跟着我们 不准生事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you can stick with us as long as you don't hold us up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.57,0:28:56.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到头来...  恐怕还是死路一条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either way... you probably won't get off this island alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.59,0:29:10.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在怎么办{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... what do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.09,0:29:17.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,仍旧去寻找你儿子  但和他们走同一个方向{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We search for your son...in the direction that they're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.60,0:29:20.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好主意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent. Excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.13,0:29:48.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sorry. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.13,0:29:50.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,又不是没看过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing you haven't seen before, Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:55.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你瘦了多少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much weight did you say you lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.14,0:29:58.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大约25磅  因为我常游泳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About 25 pounds. I've been swimming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.64,0:30:01.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你讨厌游泳  而且根本不会游{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swimming? You hate to swim. You don't even know how to swim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.15,0:30:04.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是特别去学的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.15,0:30:07.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看起来很棒  - 你也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look good. -  So do you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.65,0:30:13.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么归类?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How would you classify it, Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.16,0:30:16.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该是超级肉食性恐龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's a superpredator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.66,0:30:22.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鼻子长长的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suchimimus. Snout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.67,0:30:24.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还要再大些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, think bigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.17,0:30:25.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道是重爪龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baryonyx?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.17,0:30:26.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重爪龙没有鳍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not with that sail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.17,0:30:30.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是棘背龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spinosaurus Aegypticus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.68,0:30:35.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但它并不在遗传国际公司的目录内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember that on Ingen's list.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.68,0:30:37.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,既然不在目录内  {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it wasn't on their list,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.35,0:30:39.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那他们可能还搞了其它名堂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that makes me wonder what else they were up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.69,0:30:55.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克比  告诉我  当你攀登昆仑山时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Mr. Kirby. Tell me when you climbed K2,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.24,0:30:58.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,基地是设在两万五还是三万尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did you base camp at 25 or 30,000 feet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.20,0:31:03.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三万尺  非常接近山顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty thousand feet. We were close to the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.21,0:31:06.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那比实际山高还超出一千尺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were about a thousand feet above it, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.71,0:31:09.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是很常见的错误{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, that's a common mistake. Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.21,0:31:13.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没有克比企业  是不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no such thing as Kirby Enterprises, is there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.22,0:31:17.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是克比油漆地砖及其它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Kirby Paint and Tile Plus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:19.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所谓其它是指浴室设备{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plus stands for bathroom fixtures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.22,0:31:22.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在俄克拉荷马州的西门购物中心内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the Westgate Shopping Center, Enid, Oklahoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.23,0:31:24.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来那张支票也不能兑现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I don't suppose that check you wrote us is any good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.73,0:31:29.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会付你的  没问题的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is good. This is good. I will pay you, no matter what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.73,0:31:33.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们身处绝境  居然还被耍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are in the worse place in the world, and we're not even being paid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.74,0:31:37.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们别生气  这样好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, wait, fellas. Hold on. I'll make this up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.24,0:31:40.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将来你想装修浴室或厨房...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever do a bathroom or a kitchen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.74,0:31:43.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也不是什么雇佣兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not really a mercenary, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.25,0:31:44.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没这么说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never said I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.75,0:31:46.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那也对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.25,0:31:47.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你是干什么的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.25,0:31:49.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是中介人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm like a booking agent.{\r}
