Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.99,0:43:48.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.99,0:43:50.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿伦和你在一起吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Alan with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.50,0:43:58.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.50,0:44:01.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,余戴斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Udesky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.50,0:44:03.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,余戴斯?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Udesky?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.50,0:44:05.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.51,0:44:09.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他没死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, no, he's not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.01,0:44:11.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等一下  似乎不对劲  - 我们得去帮他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, wait! Something's not right. -  We gotta help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.51,0:44:13.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿曼达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amanda!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.52,0:44:20.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.03,0:44:31.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,圈套  它们居然设下圈套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They set a trap. They actually set a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.04,0:44:39.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在说什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.54,0:44:42.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在找什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.61,0:45:55.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.63,0:46:12.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.63,0:46:15.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克  真谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot, Eric.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.14,0:46:19.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know who I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.14,0:46:24.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  你父母也到这里找你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Your parents are here. They're looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.64,0:46:26.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一起?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.15,0:46:28.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对  一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.65,0:46:33.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不好  他们在一起就吵架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not good. They don't do so well together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.65,0:46:37.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了找你  他们相处得还不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be surprised what people can do when they have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.67,0:46:55.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是阿伦·格兰特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Alan Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.68,0:46:58.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这儿干什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.18,0:47:04.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你父母... 邀我一起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your parents, uh, invited me along.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.71,0:47:30.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的两本书我都看过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read both of your books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.71,0:47:35.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢第一本写你在岛上的书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I liked the first one more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.72,0:47:38.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前你蛮喜欢恐龙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before you were on the island. You liked dinosaurs back then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.22,0:47:41.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前它们并没有要吃我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back then they hadn't tried to eat me yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.72,0:47:48.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们搬走时留下不少东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When Ingen cleared out, they left a lot of stuff behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.23,0:47:49.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有武器吗?  {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any weapons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.67,0:47:52.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没了 我用了最后一个瓦斯弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. And I just used the last of the gas grenades.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.73,0:47:54.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你救了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I appreciate that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.24,0:48:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点  那是霸王龙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful with that. T-rex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.74,0:48:04.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会把小的恐龙吓跑  却会吸引更大的来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It scares the smaller ones, but attracts one really big one with a fin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.74,0:48:07.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是霸王龙的尿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is T-rex pee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.25,0:48:12.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么弄来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.75,0:48:14.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是不知道的好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.26,0:48:21.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要甜点吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dessert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.26,0:48:22.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.77,0:48:31.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能在岛上活八周  真的让我很惊讶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric, I have to tell you, I'm astonished that you've lasted eight weeks on this island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.27,0:48:34.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,才过了八个星期吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all it's been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.27,0:48:39.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,活着是最重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alive, and that's the important thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.28,0:48:41.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好有你  否则我必死无疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And thanks to you, that's one thing that we have in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.78,0:48:47.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看过马尔科姆博士的书吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you read Malcolm's book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.79,0:48:48.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.29,0:48:51.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.79,0:48:55.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很唠叨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I-I don't know. I mean, it was kind of preachy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.29,0:48:59.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且乱成一团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And too much chaos. Everything's chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.30,0:49:01.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他似乎自以为高人一等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seemed like the guy was kind of high on himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.80,0:49:07.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我深有同感{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's two things that we have in common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.31,0:49:14.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.81,0:49:16.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是秀颌龙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.33,0:49:29.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.83,0:49:33.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.34,0:49:42.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阿伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.36,0:50:01.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样 这不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No matter how this turns out, it wasn't your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.36,0:50:05.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克是个意志坚强的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric's always been a strong-willed kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.86,0:50:06.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一直都是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.87,0:50:10.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,后来你把宾给扯进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you throw someone like Ben Hilde brand into the mix{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.37,0:50:13.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.35,0:50:15.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"那是"什么?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Well" what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.88,0:50:19.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说这不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I'm saying...It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.88,0:50:28.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不  如果他和你一起 就不会出事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, if he'd been with you, he'd be completely safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.39,0:50:31.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你开车永远低于最高限速{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drive five miles under the speed limit, Paul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.89,0:50:35.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而我三年中撞毁了三辆车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've totaled three cars in three years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.39,0:50:39.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是三辆  别克车并没有全毁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, not three. The Buick wasn't really totaled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.40,0:50:44.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我那样说是因为  我想买新的多功能运动车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just said it was 'cause I wanted to get the S.U.V.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.41,0:50:52.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起要你来这里受罪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am so sorry that you have to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.91,0:50:56.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒不觉得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.49,0:52:16.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在堤岸边有条船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, there's a boat right alongside the bank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.49,0:52:17.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来还能开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks in good shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.50,0:52:18.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是援救船吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rescue boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.00,0:52:20.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.50,0:52:24.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前留下来的船  至少它能浮起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just something left behind. But it floats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.51,0:52:38.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们依计行事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stick to the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.02,0:52:40.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,朝海边出发{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head to the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.52,0:52:42.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不去找格兰特博士吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna look for Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.52,0:52:43.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到海岸去是他的主意 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going to the coast was Alan's idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.82,0:52:45.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若他活着   一定会朝那边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's alive, that's where he's headed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.02,0:52:47.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我同意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.03,0:52:48.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那艾瑞克呢?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Eric?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.03,0:52:53.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他很聪明  应该想到海边的机会比较大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric's a smart kid. He probably knows he stands his best chance by the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.03,0:52:56.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且大恐龙都集中在岛中间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He figures all the big dinosaurs are in the center of the island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.53,0:52:57.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.04,0:53:00.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.05,0:53:08.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know what this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.05,0:53:11.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迅猛龙的爪子  我以前也有一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a raptor claw. Used to have one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.05,0:53:13.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是化石的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fossil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.55,0:53:15.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的是新鲜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mine is new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.56,0:53:19.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,岛上你已经探勘过多少地方?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much of the island did you explore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.56,0:53:22.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直留在这附近{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stayed pretty close to the compound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.56,0:53:25.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想如果有人找我  一定会来这儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured if anyone came looking for me, that's where they'd start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.07,0:53:29.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的计划是到海边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get to the coast. That was the plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.57,0:53:32.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定  离水越近恐龙越大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure? Closer you get to the water, the bigger things get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.07,0:53:35.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果能下到峡谷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if we can find our way down into the canyon,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.07,0:53:38.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就能沿着河到海边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we could follow the river out to the coast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.58,0:53:41.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先去找你的父母{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After we find your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.08,0:53:43.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.58,0:53:44.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一步一步来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One step at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.08,0:53:46.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.09,0:53:48.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.59,0:53:51.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我老爸的卫星电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my dad's satellite phone!{\r}
