Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.60,0:54:00.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,西门中心的克比油漆和地砖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kirby Paint and Tile Plus, in Westgate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.10,0:54:02.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
