Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.12,0:54:27.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric! Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.13,0:54:30.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克  走这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric! This way! Eric! Eric!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.13,0:54:34.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈  爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.13,0:54:36.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric! Mom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.64,0:54:44.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom! Dad! Mom! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.15,0:54:54.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道能找到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew it! My God! I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.16,0:55:00.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I glad to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.16,0:55:02.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你拣到我的袋子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you got my bag.{\r}
