Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.17,0:55:19.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到电话铃响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The phone. That stupid jingle from the store, I heard it.{\r}
