Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.68,0:55:21.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你的卫星电话在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, your satellite phone. Where is it?{\r}
