Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.19,0:55:30.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 在飞机上我接了一通电话...  - 后来呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got a call on the plane, and... -  What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.19,0:55:34.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦  我借给奈许{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What! I loaned it to Nash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.19,0:55:35.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道说当他...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must've had it when he...{\r}
