Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.27,0:56:56.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿着没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's okay, Billy, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.78,0:56:59.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你还给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please give me the bag.{\r}
