Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.81,0:57:38.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的是一时冲动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took 'em on an impulse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.32,0:57:40.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只想到它价值高{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought they'd be worth a fortune,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.95,0:57:42.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少能换得十年的研究基金{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}enough to fund the dig site another ten more years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.32,0:57:45.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你相信我  我知道我这样做很愚蠢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you have to believe me. This was a stupid decision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.82,0:57:48.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是全出自于一片好意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I did it with the best intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.33,0:57:50.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,出自一片好意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the best intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.83,0:57:57.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,许多最坏的情况  就是出自一片好意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of the worst things imaginable have been done...with the best intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.34,0:58:01.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比利 依我看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy, as far as I'm concerned,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.84,0:58:05.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和建这个岛的人一样糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're no better than the people that built this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.36,0:58:25.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么  那些家伙就是为了蛋才追我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? Those things are after us because of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.36,0:58:29.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"那些家伙"知道我们有蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Those things" know we have the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.37,0:58:31.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就算丢到河里去  它们仍会追我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drop them in the river, they'll still be after us.{\r}
