Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.88,0:58:44.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在下游处有条船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a boat at the bottom, just downriver.{\r}
