Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.80,1:00:44.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好  艾瑞克  我离开你一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Eric, I'm gonna leave you just for a minute, okay?{\r}
