Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.31,1:00:53.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两分钟没有你  不会有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I can manage the next two minutes without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.32,1:00:59.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们已经团圆了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. We're all together now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.84,1:01:26.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  艾瑞克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Eric!{\r}
