Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.63,1:05:57.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们走  - 比利怎么办?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go, Eric. No, no. -  What about Billy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.15,1:06:13.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,撑下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy! Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.66,1:06:22.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away.{\r}
