Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.76,1:08:05.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,生火或什么的  好让他们能看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Build a fire or something. Something they can see from the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.77,1:08:13.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant?{\r}
