Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.79,1:08:34.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 我对他说的最后一句话吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what the last thing I said to him was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.29,1:08:36.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.79,1:08:39.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"你和建这个岛的人一样糟"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"You're as bad as the people that built this place."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.29,1:08:44.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是气话  他太年轻气盛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which wasn't true. Billy was just young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.80,1:08:45.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如此而已{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.30,1:08:50.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为男孩可分两类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a theory that there are two kinds of boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.30,1:08:52.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一类想成为天文学家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are those that want to be astronomers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.81,1:08:54.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一类想做太空人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and those that want to be astronauts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.81,1:08:58.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天文学家和古生物学家一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The astronomer, or the paleontologist,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.80,1:09:04.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在完全安全的地方做研究{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gets to study these amazing things from a place of complete safety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.32,1:09:07.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜永远不能上太空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then you never get to go into space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.82,1:09:12.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 差别就在想象和亲眼所见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. That's the difference between imagining and seeing:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.33,1:09:15.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并能亲手摸到它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be able to touch them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.33,1:09:19.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那也是比利最渴望的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's... that's all that Billy wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.84,1:09:27.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.87,1:09:58.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士  你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know something, Dr. Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.87,1:10:02.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,比利是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Billy was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.90,1:10:29.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们听{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.42,1:10:51.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在挂断前快找到它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find it before it stops ringing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.93,1:10:53.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾瑞克 你留在船上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric, you stay on that boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.93,1:10:59.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里 不对 是这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's here. Wait. Whoa-whoa, it's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.44,1:11:09.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.95,1:11:19.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.45,1:11:21.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可拥有位于瓜达拉哈市的 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too can own a time-share...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.37,1:11:22.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,渡假别墅的共同所有权{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in beautiful Guadalajara.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.96,1:11:25.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并在我们的四星级餐厅用餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enjoy a meal in one of our four-star restaurants{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.96,1:11:26.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.48,1:11:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,剩下来的电池  只够我们打一通电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off the power. You've got juice for maybe one call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.49,1:11:55.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,千万别打给美国大使馆  他们什么事也不做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you do, don't call the U.S. Embassy. They won't do a damn thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.49,1:11:58.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们过来看呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys! Come here! Look at this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.00,1:12:06.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鲣鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonitos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.50,1:12:08.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们被吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something must have spooked them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.00,1:12:11.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克比  别让引擎停下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the engine going, Mr. Kirby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.01,1:12:19.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把节流阀打开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the throttle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.52,1:12:27.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,接电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick up, pick up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.03,1:12:34.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.53,1:12:35.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.03,1:12:37.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.53,1:12:40.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.04,1:12:45.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查理 把电话拿给妈咪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie! Take the phone to Mommy now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.54,1:12:47.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快把电话拿给妈咪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, take the phone to Mommy now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.54,1:12:50.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是恐龙先生打来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the dinosaur man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.54,1:12:51.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.55,1:12:53.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, Charlie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.05,1:12:57.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查理  有没有把电话给妈咪?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie, are you taking the phone to Mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.55,1:12:59.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,查理?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.58,1:13:29.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哈 哈 哈  大家好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, ho-ho. Hi, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.59,1:13:43.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里真不错  你们好吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great to be here! Hi, there! How are you today?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.11,1:13:55.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定会很棒的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna be great!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.62,1:14:09.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁打来的?  - 恐龙先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's on the phone? -  The dinosaur man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.12,1:14:12.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  阿伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is? Alan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.13,1:14:14.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,找找看盒子里有没有武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look in the boxes! Find a weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.14,1:14:25.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,电话呢?  快去接{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the phone? There! Get the phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.65,1:14:37.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽  听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellie? Ellie, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.65,1:14:39.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你用手机吗  我听不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alan, are you on a cell phone? I can't hear you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.65,1:14:41.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,B地的河流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The river! Site "B"! The river!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.16,1:14:47.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.27,1:16:56.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.28,1:17:04.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保罗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.29,1:17:15.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.30,1:17:22.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,保罗 你这个混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paul, you jerk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.80,1:17:27.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能就这样走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't leave me like this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.31,1:17:30.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没走呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.32,1:17:51.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得几年前的夏天  我们去钓鱼吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when we went fishing a couple summers ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.33,1:17:55.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我把船卸下来时  拖车反而沉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was putting the boat in the water, and the trailer sank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.33,1:17:59.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拖吊车想把车拉上来  自己反而越陷越深{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tow truck tried to pull us out, and it got dragged in too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.34,1:18:03.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,气得司机差点揍我一顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truck driver wanted to knock my lights out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.35,1:18:10.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想念钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss fishing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.35,1:18:17.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,克比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Kirby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.86,1:18:24.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你找的那位女士...  她是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That lady you called. Who is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.86,1:18:27.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她真能帮我们吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that she can help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.36,1:18:30.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我唯一能信任的人 我欠她太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was the one person I could always count on. I owe her a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.87,1:18:33.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜一直没对她说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although I don't think I ever told her that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.87,1:18:35.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.87,1:18:39.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. You hear that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.88,1:18:42.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是海洋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ocean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.91,1:19:00.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们向我们要蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want the eggs,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.41,1:19:03.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们早死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}otherwise we'd be dead already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.92,1:19:12.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家蹲下来  它在向我们挑战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody get down. She's challenging us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.44,1:19:33.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它以为你偷了蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She thinks you stole the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.95,1:19:35.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到我后面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.97,1:19:58.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把蛋给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the eggs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.99,1:20:20.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈  快给它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.01,1:20:41.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不对  要发求救信号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, no, no. Call for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.56,1:21:29.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是直升机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a helicopter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.07,1:21:42.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant? Dr. Alan Grant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.58,1:21:43.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要叫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.58,1:21:46.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那样太危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a very bad idea!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.09,1:22:00.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要好好谢她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow. You have to thank her now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.09,1:22:03.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连海军和海军陆战队都出动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She sent the navy and the marines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.10,1:22:04.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾丽  你真是救命恩人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God bless you, Ellie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.61,1:22:18.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士  这个人是和你一起来的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant, this man with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.61,1:22:19.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.12,1:22:30.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你逃出来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.63,1:22:33.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.13,1:22:36.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我救了你的帽子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I rescued your hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.13,1:22:38.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士  我们得起飞了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant, we need to go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.63,1:22:39.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  是呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.64,1:22:44.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这倒是挺重要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's the important thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.14,1:22:46.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.14,1:22:51.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请你坐下来  系上安全带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I get you to sit here and buckle up, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.65,1:23:02.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,海影对尘暴  一共援救了五人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sea Shadow Dust Storm Zero Five, six souls on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.66,1:23:06.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,尘暴对海影  知道了  干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dust Storm Sea Shadow, roger. Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.66,1:23:12.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼呀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.67,1:23:15.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,格兰特博士 你快看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Grant, look!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.18,1:23:27.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们要飞到哪里去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think they' re going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.68,1:23:30.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  也许去找新地方筑巢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Maybe just looking for new nesting grounds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.18,1:23:33.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对他们来说外面是全新的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a whole new world for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.19,1:23:36.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别想到俄克拉荷马州来筑巢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare 'em to nest in Enid, Oklahoma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.20,1:23:43.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,咱们回家吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go home.{\r}
